--   3) all adds dead -> re-check the HP label. Back to a kill-stage number
--      (e.g. 1500000000/2000000000) -> return to the boss. Still [Immune] -> wipe EVERY
--      Default_Client NPC inside a 350 radius (never players, never the boss itself) and
--      keep re-checking until the [Immune] face is removed, then kill the boss.
--   4) boss dead -> "Lv. 10,000 Mahoraga" spawns (seen in BossHP.NameLabel) -> kill it,
